    descriptionKo: "A refined take on 버버리’s rainwear heritage, the Chelsea trench coat is cut close to the body for a clean, modern silhouette. The fitted style is made in England from shower-resistant cotton gabardine and detailed with leather-wrapped buckles. Tailored to a slim fit, the double-breasted design has a structured shoulder line, narrow sleeves, and a defined waistline. Wear it closed using the belt or open over dresses and separates to showcase the iconic check lining.\n\nDouble-breasted button closure\nHook-and-eye collar closure\nThroat latch\nEpaulettes\nStorm shield at back\nGun flap at shoulder\nLeather buckle belt and cuffs\nSide button welt pockets\nBack button vent\n버버리 Check lining and undercollar\nComes with a garment bag",
    image: "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/bb-pdp/81172411/1.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/2.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/3.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/4.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/5.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/6.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/1.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/2.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/3.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/4.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/5.jpg", "/products/bb-pdp/81172571/6.jpg"],
