    storySections: [{"titleKo": "숏 첼시 헤리티지 트렌치 코트", "bodyKo": "A refined take on 버버리’s rainwear heritage, the Chelsea trench coat is cut close to the body for a clean, modern silhouette. The fitted style is made in England from shower-resistant cotton gabardine and detailed with leather-wrapped buckles. Tailored to a slim fit, the double-breasted design has a structured shoulder line, narrow sleeves, and a defined waistline. Wear it closed using the belt or open over dresses and separates to showcase the iconic check lining.\n\nDouble-breasted button closure\nHook-and-eye collar closure\nThroat latch\nEpaulettes\nStorm shield at back\nGun flap at shoulder\nLeather buckle belt and cuffs\nSide button welt pockets\nBack button vent\n버버리 Check lining and undercollar\nComes with a garment bag", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디테일", "bodyKo": "Slim fit: this style is cut to a fitted silhouette. Fits true to size, take your normal size.#Length: 87cm/34.3in (size UK 10)#Model’s height: 180cm/5ft 11in. Model wears size UK 10#Outer: 100% cotton*#Lining: 100% cotton*#Sleeve lining: 100% viscose#Buckles: 100% calf leather#Specialist dry clean#Made in Yorkshire, England#*The main material and body lining of this product contain 100% organic cotton. · 슬림핏: 몸에 꼭 맞는 실루엣으로 재단된 스타일입니다. 정사이즈로 맞으니 평소 사이즈를 선택하세요. · 길이: 87cm/34.3in(UK 사이즈 10) · 모델 키: 180cm/5ft 11in. 모델은 UK 10 사이즈를 착용했습니다. · 겉감: 100% 코튼* · 안감: 100% 코튼* · 소매 안감: 비스코스 100% · 버클: 송아지 가죽 100%", "image": "/products/bb-pdp/81172411/2.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["Slim fit: this style is cut to a fitted silhouette. Fits true to size, take your normal size.#Length: 87cm/34.3in (size UK 10)#Model’s height: 180cm/5ft 11in. Model wears size UK 10#Outer: 100% cotton*#Lining: 100% cotton*#Sleeve lining: 100% viscose#Buckles: 100% calf leather#Specialist dry clean#Made in Yorkshire, England#*The main material and body lining of this product contain 100% organic cotton.", "슬림핏: 몸에 꼭 맞는 실루엣으로 재단된 스타일입니다. 정사이즈로 맞으니 평소 사이즈를 선택하세요.", "길이: 87cm/34.3in(UK 사이즈 10)", "모델 키: 180cm/5ft 11in. 모델은 UK 10 사이즈를 착용했습니다.", "겉감: 100% 코튼*", "안감: 100% 코튼*", "소매 안감: 비스코스 100%", "버클: 송아지 가죽 100%", "전문 드라이클리닝", "영국 요크셔에서 생산됨", "*The main material and body lining of this product contain 100% organic cotton.", "* 본 제품의 주요 소재와 본체 안감은 100% 오가닉 코튼을 함유하고 있습니다."],
