    descriptionKo: "버버리 Brit Shine – the new lipstick that goes beyond, offering hours of shine and plumper lips over time*.  \n\nIts glossy balm texture combines an intense pigmentation and a multifaceted shine that reflects light from all angles, offering a smoothing and resurfacing full-lip effect for up to six hours. The colour remains homogeneous and doesn’t bleed or smudge. Designed to suit all lips – even the most sensitive. Lightweight and non-sticky, the hybrid texture glides seamlessly on the lips to feel like a protective shield against dryness, dehydration and discomfort. The scent of the formula is a rose petal signature boosted by fruits and greens that enhances the wearing experience. \n\nActive hydration: infused with natural-origin ingredients, 버버리 Brit Shine’s comfortable formula provides instant hydration** that lasts up to seven hours. The lips feel soft and moisturised all day long. \n\nOvertime plump and protection: enriched with a blend of collagen-boosting peptide, rosa damascena and safflower oil, the formula helps to strengthen the lip barrier and limits water loss, leading to plumper* lips after 28 days of use.\n\nA unique British-inspired colour range: available in 15 statement shades inspired by 버버리’s British roots. The range features Heritage Honey, inspired by the colour of the 버버리 trench coat and Tea Party, a classic English tradition – alongside Kensington Crush and Pimlico Sunset, named after two of London’s iconic neighbourhoods. The lipstick case features touches of g",
