    descriptionKo: "버버리 expands its home fragrance collection with the addition of a small candle housed in a bespoke vessel. Scented with zesty ginger and sweet notes of caramel, the wax is hand-poured into the bone china vessel – each hand-cast at a ceramics workshop in Stoke-on-Trent, a region renowned for its pottery craft. Crafted with a raised Equestrian Knight Design motif and 버버리 logo at the base. Ideal for gifting, the custom designed presentation box is wrapped in a 버버리 Check sleeve with an Equestrian Knight Design sticker to denote the scent inside.\n\nTop notes: ​Malabar black pepper, Jamaican ginger, Grenadian nutmeg​\nMiddle notes: patchouli, Bulgarian rose, Tuscan cypress​\nBase notes: Thai benzoin, tonka bean, guaiac wood, Turkish caramel, Puglian almond\nBurn time: 40 hours",
